  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yVrXKMd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"252\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/J9jY4Z6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YeQZceJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"233\" height=\"76\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Dr_prof_Luigi\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/24auqwO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"234\" height=\"76\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-end-of-minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Om4BpzM.png\" width=\"233\" height=\"76\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong><br></strong><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-parts-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/d51JHWL.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"120\"></a><br></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>本模组需要以下前置模组：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Transport Simulator (Minecraft 运输模拟器)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-parts-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">UNU Parts Pack (UNU 零件包)</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>下载我的其他资源包！</strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-civilian-pack-for-mts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-civilian-pack-for-mts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">UNU Civilian - 来自 UNU 的高质量民用车辆、卡车、飞机和火车<br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-military-pack-for-mts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">UNU Military - 来自 UNU 的高质量军事装备！</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mts-air-cooled-vehicles-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MTS Air-Cooled Pack - 大众、科尔维拉及其他风冷汽车！</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iconic-movie-vehicles-pack-mts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iconic Film Vehicles - 2015 经典影片载具<br><br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/fallout-mc\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>尝试官方服务器！</strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>这款末日主题资源包 featuring BlackThorne 最大的竞争对手：RedCliffe 共和国！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>虽然 BlackThorne 拥有崭新、华丽的载具，但 RedCliffe 只能利用旧世界的残骸。然而凭借他们的聪明才智，他们能够抵御帝国的进攻。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>目前包含若干末日风格载具，更多载具即将推出！</p>",
